mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course covers fundamental concepts of organic synthesis, design methodologies for organic synthesis, methods for constructing organic molecular scaffolds, selectivity in organic synthetic reactions, asymmetric synthesis, novel methods and techniques in organic synthesis, as well as development trends.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
