                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>本课程以课堂讲授为主，采用启发式教学，通过实例配合授课内容，并就所选专题学生进行讨论和报告。</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
